body:

Adds a simple portal page to your forum. Most options live in the management panel.

The portal is served at `/portal` by default. To change that, add this line to `flaskbb.cfg`, and pick a prefix that doesn't clash with one of FlaskBB's own URL prefixes:

```python
PLUGIN_PORTAL_URL_PREFIX = "/yourportalurlprefix"
```
